        rdfs:label "Kriegman et al. (2020, 2021) Xenobot evolutionary biomechanics & kinematic self-replication — Morphological realism / specimen match: 54/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Vendors `datasets/xenobot_evolutionary_biobots/xenopus_biobot_specimen.jpg` (CC BY 4.0 micrograph of an evolved Xenopus laevis Xenobot), but Pass 1 lacks automated 2D convex-hull solidity/concavity measurement and chromatic R-G/R-B segmentation of the red-fluorescent contractile cardiac progenitor core." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
